#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:5
#: 4c4453a035704d3facf1f9444a84386f
msgid "FPort Receivers"
msgstr "FPort 接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:7
#: 42659fe374dc4410972ecf85477603dc
msgid "ArduPilot supports FPort/FPort2."
msgstr "ArduPilot 支持 FPort/FPort2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:9
#: 6a7ffff77dc4459c9b21738566bb508d
msgid ""
"FPort protocol combines SBus RC control information being sent to the "
"autopilot with bi-directional telemetry information to/from the autopilot on"
" a single wire high baud rate bus."
msgstr "FPort 协议将 SBus RC 控制信息发送至飞控，同时在单根高波特率总线上实现飞控与接收机之间的双向数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:11
#: 608cad83cf5b460e8262149ada4dfc2f
msgid ""
"Many FRSky X series and R series receivers have this capability, either "
"natively or with firmware upgrade."
msgstr "许多 FRSky X 系列和 R 系列接收机原生支持或通过固件升级支持此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:13
#: cff5296dbebe4ee9bfc4ccbc0a88a31b
msgid ""
"Connection to the autopilot and configuration varies from autopilot to "
"autopilot since their UART capabilities vary. Most F4 cpu based autopilots "
"do not have controllable inverters in front of the UART TX and RX, and "
"require either an external bi-directional inverter, as SPort connections do "
"or the use of the \"un-inverted FPort pad/pin\" some receivers provide since"
" the FPort protocol has opposite signaling levels than normal UART "
"operation. Most F7 and H7 autopilots, on the other hand, have internal "
"inverters, and can be directly connected from the receiver's FPort to their "
"UARTs TX input line."
msgstr ""
"连接飞控的方式和配置因飞控的 UART 能力不同而有所差异。大多数基于 F4 CPU 的飞控在 UART TX 和 RX "
"前没有可控电平转换器，因此需要外置双向电平转换器（如 SPort 连接方式），或使用部分接收机提供的「非反转 FPort 焊盘/引脚」——因为 "
"FPort 协议的信号电平与普通 UART 操作相反。而大多数 F7 和 H7 飞控内置了电平转换器，可直接将接收机的 FPort 连接至飞控的 "
"UART TX 输入线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:16
#: a9ab914332784c1e8e8afbb41db6b592
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports both 16 and 24 channels FPort2 but telemetry is enabled "
"only for 16 channels mode."
msgstr "ArduPilot 支持 16 通道和 24 通道的 FPort2，但数传仅在 16 通道模式下启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:19
#: 51dc4670e02b4d5e9991849a2940525d
msgid "Telemetry protocol"
msgstr "数传协议"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:21
#: 1a12870137324993bee04ffe1b1d8de8
msgid ""
"ArduPilot will send telemetry data to the receiver over Fport using the "
":ref:`Passthrough telemetry <common-frsky-passthrough>` protocol. To get "
"sensors to show up in OpenTX you have to install and enable a script which "
"can display Passthrough telemetry, such as  :ref:`Yaapu FrSky Telemetry "
"Script for OpenTX<common-frsky-yaapu>`. Otherwise the only sensor that will "
"be discovered would be GPS."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 将通过 FPort 使用 :ref:`透传数传 <common-frsky-passthrough>` "
"协议向接收机发送数传数据。若要让传感器显示在 OpenTX 中，需安装并启用能够显示透传数传的脚本，例如 :ref:`Yaapu FrSky "
"Telemetry Script for OpenTX<common-frsky-yaapu>`。否则唯一能被识别的传感器只有 GPS。"

